This repository holds two different kinds of work, under two licences: the
book, and the software that builds it.


THE BOOK  —  Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Copyright (c) 2026 Akizumi

Everything that is the book: its prose, mathematics, figures, exercises and
solutions, the worked examples that accompany it, and the editorial material
written to produce it.

    src/                 every chapter and section, and the preface
    authoring/           the style, notation and drafting standards
    widgets/             the interactive figures
    spelling.txt         the book's vocabulary
    blueprint/           the chapter plans and coverage map
    code/                the runnable examples for each chapter

is licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. You may share and adapt it, including
translating it, provided you give credit, do not use it commercially, and
license what you build on it the same way. The full text is in
LICENSE-CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0.txt; a plain-language summary is at
<https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/>.

The rendered editions built from these sources — the website and the PDFs —
carry the same licence.


THE ENGINE  —  MIT
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Copyright (c) 2026 Akizumi

The software that turns those sources into a book, and which is not specific to
this book's subject:

    build.py, build/      the build system
    filters/              the Pandoc Lua filters
    templates/            the HTML and LaTeX templates
    latex/                the LaTeX styles written for this book
    tools/                the maintenance and measurement scripts
    tests/                the test suite
    config/               the book's configuration

