Where a file is not listed above, the principle decides it: if it is part of
the book, it is under CC BY-NC-SA; if it is part of the machinery that would
build any book, it is under MIT.


NEITHER  —  latex/sleek/
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

latex/sleek/ vendors two files from a third party's LaTeX style. Their terms
could not be established: the upstream repository named in latex/sleek/README.md
returns 404, and neither file carries a licence statement. Neither licence above
covers that directory. Before redistributing, establish the terms with the
author or replace the two files.
